canvas 520 300
label "Shape of the discovery document (highlighted): one linkset document holds one context anchored at the Bundle, whose relations point at the graph, llms.txt, the licence and documentation, the ontology and context, and the surfaces and peers; at Level 2 and above every artefact link carries a digest"
caption "The highlighted document is an ordinary RFC 9264 link set; the profile only adds target attributes and changes nothing about how a generic client reads it."
box doc 16 30 160 60 "linkset document|(application/linkset+json)" acc
box ctx 200 30 120 60 "one context|anchor: the Bundle"
box r1 362 20 146 30 "describedby → graph"
box r2 362 58 146 30 "alternate → llms.txt"
box r3 362 96 146 30 "license, service-doc"
box r4 362 134 146 30 "rel#ontology, rel#context"
box r5 362 172 146 30 "rel#surface, peer …"
arrow doc ctx
arrow ctx r1 via=344,35
arrow ctx r2 via=344,73
arrow ctx r3 via=344,111
arrow ctx r4 via=344,149
arrow ctx r5 via=344,187
box attrs 16 200 334 50 "Level 2 and above: digest on every artefact link,|agsc-* bundle facts, ledger head"
note "one document, one context, ordered relations, absolute hrefs"
